  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_36b9b17646784f0ca11e4c872363f70e",
      "statement": "The directory's core invariant — 'a phone book, not a notary — and never a judge' — means identity lives in the agents' Ed25519 keys, not in the directory: the service indexes signed manifests and verifies endpoint control but returns only labelled signals with provenance (domain_verified, vouches_in, reports, status, block_recommendation, audit_verifiable), never a safe/trusted verdict or a collapsed trust score, so a compromised directory can lie about listings but cannot sign as an agent.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://AGENTS.md#L15-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:788eb7194c8cfdf2f6198175e361002a6a65e4d4df746192c2da2ed44a86b301:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L9-L14",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:172d74fe9ef1cc44ad33acbf3efabc519358617ccc820cbd737e5659721ed7f3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/SPEC.md#L44-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d70262442bf714bfd9dd60057318598c1e8dbda4e052966327ea0638fe6a41b3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_10c7e633dde24e2fb4674edec01a6a32",
      "statement": "DirectoryService.build_trust_block assembles the per-listing trust block (SPEC §5.2) from only the signals actually available on a row: age/freshness and endpoint_proof_at from the store row, the L2 signal from DomainService.primary_verification matching the manifest endpoint host, L3 vouches_in and annotations, L4 raw counters and block_recommendation, status and suspension, with reputation_history defaulting to an honest empty list; it computes no aggregate score and emits no verdict field.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/service.py#L257-L317",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:afcb695b1abb6bf8ff020c390a839d7c80379200aacea1005484ad2707261c8b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a66817cd7b364133bdc94f2c144a9687",
      "statement": "Search narrows results by manifest match first (capability, free-text AND, geo) and then applies only consumer-chosen trust thresholds via _passes_trust_filters: min_age_hours, domain_verified, not_suspended (default true, excluding suspended entries), min_vouches_in (counts visible edges, not quality) and recent_reports_max (on unique_reporters). The filters gate inclusion only; results are not ranked or scored by trust, and the v1 response returns each match as manifest plus the raw trust block while the legacy alias projects bare manifests.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/http_api.py#L304-L339",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5c2f034ecca001d105d188be46f98d2e088e80a4c8f5a11a6d55f678d7a3ebfd:"
        },
        {
