          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:00a1520e4add6973fb7933fe93c34111e360e1c4f850e5f44210cb2079251305:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e3e9e02683df415a90057ed06aa6be8c",
      "statement": "L2 domain verification is performed server-side: DomainService.request_verification issues a single-use token for method dns_txt or https_well_known, and confirm() requires the live agent's signature, an unexpired unused challenge, and the manifest endpoint host to equal the domain or a subdomain (DOMAIN_ENDPOINT_MISMATCH otherwise) before delegating the DNS/TLS control check to the injectable resolver and persisting a verification valid for domain_verification_ttl_days (90); the trust block surfaces only the primary verification whose domain covers the endpoint host.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/config.py#L47-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8cc748b63790f5932af0668c6b050e047f22b8dc72a1f79f0f6342f343791b2b:"
