    {
      "id": "claim_4ba3a22eca09403e9e94b1522a3a4bde",
      "statement": "block_recommendation is a pure function of recent raw counters — it returns {'default_max_contact_rate_h': 1} when at least 2 unique eligible reporters appear in the fraud or payment_fraud classes within the 7-day window — and is advisory data exposed in the trust block that never blocks or throttles anyone.",
